v2.3.0 Release notes
  - Smoother video from remote cameras, including GoPros, over long broadcasts
  - Remote cameras stay in sync after a WiFi hiccup when you switch back to them
  - Smoother instant replays of remote camera action
  - The info panel shows camera frame rate and drops, heat, and the stream's send queue, on the broadcaster and the remote control
  - Fix the broadcaster slowing down after switching between cameras many times
  - Help updates
